      "content": "This perspective describes a deeply painful cycle often seen in relationships where one partner struggles with intense mental health challenges, not because of selfishness, but because their internal struggles are swallowing them whole. Your desire to step aside comes from a place of overwhelming guilt and love, but staying to get help for yourself is actually the most selfless act you can take to prevent that suffering from spreading to everyone around you. Please reach out to a crisis helpline or a psychiatrist; sometimes the \"weight\" only disappears once the internal fog lifts with professional support.",
