      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's what everyone says, and it feels like a lie. even if i get better, there's always going to be the damage i've already done. the years of stress, the energy i've sucked out of them... i can't just 'fix' that. honestly, it feels like the most loving thing i could actually do is just stop being a burden. wouldn't it be more selfless to just let them be happy without me?",
